Package: nosh-debian-shims
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nosh-service-management, nosh-service-command-shim, nosh-systemv-shims
Suggests: 
Recommends: 
#Conflicts: sysvinit-core (<= 2.88dsf-59.9), init-system-helpers (>= 1.48)
#Provides: init-system-helpers
Description: Debian shim service and system management utilities
 This package provides shims for Debian service and system management commands.
  * chkconfig, invoke-rc.d, update-rc.d, deb-systemd-invoke
 .
 The shims simply invoke native service management commands.
 .
 It satisfies any packages that depend from init-system-helpers in order to obtain these commands.
 .
 This chkconfig is a shim for the original IRIX command of that name, and thus is not syntax compatible with the chkconfig found in non-Debian-related Linux-based operating systems such as CentOS.

