Package: nosh-run-via-mewburn-rc
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nosh-service-management (>=1.33), systemd, nosh-bundles (>=1.40)
Suggests: 
Recommends: 
Description: Run the nosh service manager and daemontools service scanner via Mewburn rc
 This package provides rc.d scripts for running the nosh service manager under Mewburn rc, instead of running the nosh system manager.
 It disables the nosh sysinit.target, on the basis that Mewburn rc is doing that part of the work.

