Package: nosh-run-djbdns
Architecture: amd64
Section: web
Depends: nosh-exec, nosh-service-management (>=1.33), nosh-bundles, djbdns
Provides:
Suggests:
Recommends: djbdns (>=12)
Conflicts:
Description: Run the djbdns services.
 This package causes the various djbdns services to run.
 .
 The old-style global services are disabled.
 .
 The new-style services are configured with the tinydns_network_addresses, walldns_network_addresses, dnscache_network_addresses, and taiclockd_network_addresses settings in /etc/rc.conf.local or /etc/rc.conf .

